<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main class="docs-shell container">
  <aside class="docs-nav"><strong>Dokumentasi</strong><a href="#auth">Autentikasi</a><a href="#create">Create payment</a><a href="#status">Cek status</a><a href="#sync">Sinkronisasi</a><a href="#callback">Callback</a></aside>
  <article class="docs-content"><div class="eyebrow"><span></span> REST API v1</div><h1>Hubungkan bot atau website Anda</h1><p class="lead">API MerchantFlow menerima dan mengembalikan JSON. Semua request API merchant wajib menggunakan HTTPS pada production.</p>
    <section id="auth"><h2>Autentikasi</h2><p>Kirim API key melalui header berikut.</p><pre><code>X-API-Key: mf_test_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
Content-Type: application/json</code></pre></section>
    <section id="create"><div class="endpoint"><b class="method post">POST</b><code>/api/v1/payments</code></div><h2>Create payment</h2><pre><code>curl -X POST "<%= appUrl %>/api/v1/payments" \\
  -H "X-API-Key: mf_test_xxx" \\
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\
  -d '{
    "order_id": "INV-1001",
    "amount": 50000,
    "description": "Paket VPS",
    "customer": {
      "name": "Budi",
      "email": "budi@example.com",
      "phone": "08123456789"
    },
    "callback_url": "https://merchant.example/webhook"
  }'</code></pre><h3>Response 201</h3><pre><code>{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "order_id": "INV-1001",
    "status": "pending",
    "amount": 50000,
    "qr_url": "https://...",
    "deeplink_url": "https://...",
    "checkout_url": "<%= appUrl %>/pay/pay_xxx",
    "expires_at": "2026-07-24T15:00:00.000Z"
  }
}</code></pre></section>
    <section id="status"><div class="endpoint"><b class="method get">GET</b><code>/api/v1/payments/:orderId</code></div><h2>Cek status lokal</h2><p>Mengambil status terakhir yang tersimpan di database.</p></section>
    <section id="sync"><div class="endpoint"><b class="method post">POST</b><code>/api/v1/payments/:orderId/sync</code></div><h2>Sinkronisasi</h2><p>Meminta status terbaru ke Midtrans dan memperbarui database.</p></section>
    <section id="callback"><h2>Callback pembayaran</h2><p>MerchantFlow mengirim POST JSON ketika status berubah. Verifikasi body mentah menggunakan HMAC SHA-256 dan webhook secret Anda.</p><pre><code>X-MerchantFlow-Event: payment.paid
X-MerchantFlow-Delivery: uuid
X-MerchantFlow-Signature: sha256=hex_signature</code></pre><pre><code>const expected = crypto
  .createHmac('sha256', WEBHOOK_SECRET)
  .update(rawBody)
  .digest('hex');</code></pre></section>
  </article>
</main>
